e":"維王","kind":"person","person_id":"lpc_d9c_352","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p052","chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-shiji110-134","person_id":"lpc_d9c_352","title":"渠","kind":"unclassified","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p052","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/110.json"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji110-134:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p052","start":134,"end":135,"surface":"渠","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:m052-0131","usage":"narrative","normalized_date":{"era":"BCE","era_year":103,"year":-102,"year_numbering":"astronomical","precision":"year","status":"editorial_provisional","original_quote":"其明年春，漢使浞野侯破奴將二萬餘騎出朔方西北二千餘里，期至浚稽山而還。浞野侯既至期而還，左大都尉欲發而覺，單于誅之，發左方兵擊浞野。浞野侯行捕首虜得數千人。還，未至受降城四百里，匈奴兵八萬騎圍之。浞野侯夜自出求水，匈奴閒捕，生得浞野侯，因急擊其軍。軍中郭縱爲護，維王爲渠，相與謀曰：「及諸校尉畏亡將軍而誅之，莫相勸歸。」軍遂沒於匈奴。匈奴兒單于大喜，遂遣奇兵攻受降城。不能下，乃寇入邊而去。其明年，單于欲自攻受降城，未至，病死。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu","source_id":"s-shiji110-xiongnu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-110-xiongnu:p052","quote_passage_ref":"data/corpus/shiji/110.json"}],"references":[{"title":"《資治通鑑》平行事件","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=資治通鑑/卷021&oldid=1511468","quote":"遣浚稽將軍趙破奴將二萬餘騎出朔方西北二千餘里","scope":"received_parallel_event","image_verified":false},{"title":"《資治通鑑》數位編輯紀年標題","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=資治通鑑/卷021&oldid=1511468","quote":"太初二年（戊寅，公元前一零三年）","scope":"digital_editorial_regnal_year_equivalence_only","image_verified":false}],"rationale":"其明年春的出兵與左大都尉事洩、破奴生擒對讀通鑑太初二年同役，暫記前103年、天文年-102；本段末第二個其明年另前102年，不把全段套單一年。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"basis":{"kind":"parallel_event","source_event_quote":"漢使浞野侯破奴將二萬餘騎出朔方西北二千餘里","reference_url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=資治通鑑/卷021&oldid=1511468","reference_event_quote":"遣浚稽將軍趙破奴將二萬餘騎出朔